          "gate": 4,
          "symbol": "InstallTransaction",
          "reason": "Every installer's exit status comes from the shared transaction's finish(), so a Pier that is not running is never reported installed."
        },
        {
          "gate": 4,
          "id": "service-start-watch",
          "reason": "The Windows installer waits for the Pier while it reports start progress and reports it installed only once the shared watch proves it running, so a slow start is not a failed install and a stalled, stopped or unreadable one is never success.",
